Here you go! Save this in a README.md file in your backend folder 👇

CanteenWallet API Documentation
Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api/v1

Auth APIs (Public)
MethodEndpointBodyDescriptionPOST/auth/parent/login{ "mobile": "9876543210" }Send OTP to parentPOST/auth/parent/verify-otp{ "pid": 1, "otp": "123456" }Verify OTP and get tokenPOST/auth/user/login{ "username": "admin", "password": "password123" }Cashier or Admin login

Parent APIs (Protected — PARENT token)
MethodEndpointBodyDescriptionGET/parent/dashboardNoneGet balance and last 5 transactionsGET/parent/transactionsNoneGet full transaction historyGET/parent/transactions?from=2025-05-01&to=2025-05-18NoneFiltered transactionsPOST/parent/topup{ "amount": 500 }Mock top up wallet

Student APIs (Protected — CASHIER token)
MethodEndpointBodyDescriptionGET/students/search?q=STU001NoneSearch by barcodeGET/students/search?q=AdityaNoneSearch by nameGET/students/1/balanceNoneGet student details and balanceGET/students/stationsNoneGet all stationsGET/students/day-summaryNoneGet today's summary

Menu APIs (Protected)
MethodEndpointBodyDescriptionGET/menuNoneGet all active menu itemsPOST/menu{ "name": "Pasta", "rate": 45 }Add new item (Admin only)PUT/menu/1{ "name": "Pasta", "rate": 50 }Update item (Admin only)PUT/menu/1/status{ "status": "Inactive" }Disable item (Admin only)

Coupon APIs (Protected — CASHIER token)
MethodEndpointBodyDescriptionPOST/couponsSee belowCreate coupon and deduct wallet
Coupon Body:
json{
    "studentID": 1,
    "mode": "Wallet",
    "items": [
        { "itemID": 1, "rate": 60 },
        { "itemID": 7, "rate": 30 }
    ]
}

Admin APIs (Protected — ADMIN token)
MethodEndpointBodyDescriptionGET/admin/dashboardNoneOverview statsGET/admin/depositsNoneAll parent balancesPOST/admin/manual-topup{ "parentID": 1, "amount": 500, "note": "Cash received" }Manual top upGET/admin/salesNoneToday's sales reportGET/admin/sales?from=2025-05-01&to=2025-05-18NoneFiltered sales reportGET/admin/usersNoneAll users listPOST/admin/users{ "username": "cashier3", "password": "pass123", "level": "Cashier" }Create new user

How to use token in Postman
Header:
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

Test order:

Auth — login and get token
Parent APIs — use parent token
Student APIs — use cashier token
Menu APIs — use cashier or admin token
Coupon APIs — use cashier token
Admin APIs — use admin token

